  "description": "Block Farm Editor For Umbraco.\n        Allows for easy on page editing using the built in Umbraco data types and property editors.\n        1.0.0 initial release for testing.\n        1.0.1 updated the licensing to be more cost effective\n        1.0.2 Implemented a AddBlockFarmEditor Method.  Removed Composer.  Will ReAdd that in a seperate project.\n        1.0.3 Added in the parent block edit functionality.\n        1.0.4 Fully integrated the umbraco valueeditors and converters.\n        1.1.0 Added the show layers feature and stabilized the block movement.\n        1.1.1 Resolved a movment issue with sibling areas.\n        1.1.2 Resolved issue with the block list",
